  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="25a5961f-2e37-507b-b25b-820dbdf304f9" activityNameId="77a88d5b-1dcf-5ad8-b1b6-715e6c6be10c" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Light emitting diode, LED, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Light emitting diode, LED, at plant
The data represent a typical light emitting diode (LED) for hole-through mounting, used in the information and communication technology. Material data are approximated by using respective information from the dataset “diode, glass-, for through-hole mounting”. Infrastructure and production efforts are based on own assumptions. The dataset represents 1 kg of 5mm LEDs with a weight of 0.35 gram/unit. The dataset was updated in 2023 to reflect global production of the ICT components, i.e., globalized material and energy in the inventory; UUID: 8d28990c-9337-3baa-ba17-8ada4878b29e
This dataset covers raw material input and production efforts for the production of currently used light emitting diodes (LED) for hole-through mounting technology.
Location: Data represent a global valuable composition of glass diodes for through-hole mounting technology, used as a first approximation for LEDs.
Technology: average diode production technology, comprising the diode wafer production (cleaing, masking, etching, doping, oxidising, metal deposition) and the final assembly of the diode (wafer sawing, die bonding, moulding, trimming and forming)
Time period: Unspecified
Production volume: 
Sampling: literature
Extrapolations: see Geography &amp; Technology
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_8d28990c-9337-3baa-ba17-8ada4878b29e.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
      <geography geographyId="f4808887-5a57-5892-975e-ba0565a93e23" geographyContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83">
